# A team around the Endministrator.
# Originally written in words:
#   "Chen: battle, combo, Endmin combo, Ember combo (we let ourselves get hit),
#    Chen combo (potential 5 comes off cooldown fast), Endmin battle,
#    Pogranichnik combo"
title: Endmin core: Chen / Endmin / Ember / Pogranichnik
team: Chen Qianyu, Endministrator, Ember, Pogranichnik

variant: basic
Chen Qianyu: BS > CS
Endministrator: CS
Ember: CS          [trigger: "when the controlled operator is attacked" — we take the hit]
Chen Qianyu: CS    [P5: Soar to the Stars cooldown −3 s, it is back in time]
Endministrator: BS [Crush: eats every Vulnerable stack]
Pogranichnik: CS   [trigger: "when Crush or Breach consumed stacks"]

# Alternative: split stack consumption over two cycles, so that the
# Endministrator's Crush lands inside Pogranichnik's Breach debuff
# (Physical DMG Taken).
variant: Breach window
cycle 1:
Chen Qianyu: BS > CS
Endministrator: CS
Ember: CS
Chen Qianyu: CS
Pogranichnik: BS   [Breach: eats the stacks and applies Physical DMG Taken]
Pogranichnik: CS
cycle 2:
Chen Qianyu: BS > CS [build the stacks again]
Endministrator: BS [Crush, now inside the Breach debuff]
Pogranichnik: CS
